{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50785","headline":"题海陵监李端公後亭十韵 · 张祜","name":"题海陵监李端公後亭十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古城连废地，规画自初心。\n眺出红亭址，裁成绿树林。\n竹欹丛岸势，池满到檐阴。\n暗草通溪远，闲花落院深。\n上帘新鷰入，抛叶小鱼沉。\n晚影移罇惜，残芳秉烛寻。\n风兰曳衣绣，露柳柫头簪。\n属咏聊题极，垂竿旋屈针。\n短桥多凭看，高堞几登临。\n漫厕宾阶末，无因和至音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50785.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50785","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}